Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go see a sky without
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,a city in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A real sky\, with the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.89,0:00:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,dust of an entire galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,smeared across it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The kind of sky that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,makes you sit down on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the ground because your knees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,stop working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of us have forgotten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that stars are the default
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,setting of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Light pollution made them rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive three hours out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you've been missing.
